# Combinational Logic Modules

This folder contains foundational combinational logic circuits and their verification environments.

## 1. Silly Function (Boolean Logic)
* **Design File:** `design.sv`
* **Testbench File:** `testbench.sv`
* **Description:** A behavioral implementation of a simple 3-input combinational logic gate based on the equation `y = ~a & ~b & ~c | a & ~b & ~c | a & ~b & c`.
* **Verification:** The testbench applies stimulus to cover multiple input states. 

